    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="links">
      Related: <a class="link-inline" href="/promql-explainer/">PromQL Explainer</a> for the queries
      inside the panels,
      <a class="link-inline" href="/alertmanager-route-tester/">Alertmanager Route Tester</a> for where
      the alerts beside them land, the
      <a class="link-inline" href="/prometheus-relabel-tester/">Prometheus Relabel Tester</a> for the
      labels your variables filter on, and the
      <a class="link-inline" href="/json-yaml-converter/">JSON ↔ YAML Converter</a> when the
      provisioning file around the dashboard needs reshaping — or browse the full
      <a class="link-inline" href={`${navLinks[0].href}/`}>tools directory</a>.
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="disclaimer">
      Not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Grafana Labs. "Grafana" is a trademark of
